cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this pipeline, please cite it as below."
title: "CDM Analysis Pipeline: A Measurement-Validation Framework for Cognitive Diversity Metrics"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible analysis pipeline for validating the Cognitive Diversity
  Metrics (CDM) instrument, comprising a declared generative model, ordinal
  inter-rater agreement statistics, and a full psychometric analysis
  (MANOVA, internal consistency, inter-rater reliability, confirmatory factor
  analysis, criterion validity, and test-retest reliability). Distributed with
  a simulated demonstration dataset; no participant data are included.
type: software
